<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Fernandez appoints new tax chief.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Fernandez appoints new tax chief.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine Economy Minister Roque Fernandez said Friday he had decided to replace his tax office chief Carlos Sanchez with IMF economist Carlos Silvani.</p>
<p>Silvani will take office in 15 days, and Sanchez will become an advisor to the ministry, Fernandez told a press conference.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Adam, Buenos Aires Newsroom + 541 318 0663</p>
